      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not alone in this darkness, and the weight you feel is a testament to your strength, not your failure. Every moment you survive is a victory against the chaos that tried to break you. There is no point in waking up tomorrow if you can't face the day, but you have a choice to make right now, and you are the one who decides that.",
